{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261005222854_688e8b49","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_a29588b0f50c713d2ee49eae","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005222854_688e8b49","chunk_index":6,"job_id":"mwjob_b263247ee0f620765b0a442f","precondition_digest":"db9e2160842cb61e13e728128f749f9e5d2f83cc6d60fa35f8ce6f52a79c1352","project_id":"proj_user_f738c43b16eb","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_40b95bf8c42f0bf9","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_2c8666e98041cb2f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_cdc73665abfefe92","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_01db4d1715af4e68"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005222854_688e8b49","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"入选标准模块：年龄18-75岁，性别不限；LVEF≤40%（ECHO评估）且NYHA II-III级；筛选前≥4周稳定剂量GDMT仍有心衰症状","quote_sha256":"29b99c94c0be69547df001d8af041022ff0014e298fd8e33289fed7f5acb21a7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_inclusion_criteria"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_inclusion_criteria"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[],"heading":"入选标准","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"受试者须同时满足以下全部入选标准方可入组本研究：（1）年龄18至75周岁（含），性别不限；（2）经超声心动图（ECHO）评估左室射血分数（LVEF）≤40%，且纽约心脏协会（NYHA）心功能分级为II级或III级；（3）筛选前已接受稳定剂量指南导向的药物治疗（GDMT）至少4周，仍存在心力衰竭相关症状。上述三项条件须于筛选期内全部满足，任一条件不符合即视为筛选失败。","rationale":"三项入选标准直接来源于当前项目已确认研究定义中的入选标准模块，与方案全文初稿章节包中5.3节当前正文一致。医学经理需确认：ECHO评估是否限定为特定切面或方法学要求；'稳定剂量GDMT'是否需在本章或合并用药章节进一步界定具体药物类别与剂量稳定判定标准；NYHA分级由谁评估及评估时点。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（入选标准）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_40b95bf8c42f0bf9","section_number":"5.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:587fc9438b6a8b3d671eec62","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005222854_688e8b49","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理提供或确认本项目筛选失败定义、重复检查条件与次数、重新筛选触发条件及筛选编号管理规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_screening_failure_rules","missing_source_classes":["本项目筛选失败与重新筛选实施规则"],"target":"5.5节正文"}],"heading":"筛选失败与重新筛选","missing_source_classes":["本项目筛选失败与重新筛选实施规则（含重复检查条件、重新筛选触发条件、筛选编号管理、筛选期时间窗）"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本项目缺少专属的筛选失败与重新筛选实施规则文件。公司语料中CMD-D001-AD II期方案包含筛选失败定义、重复检查1次及重新筛选条件等条款，但该条款属于另一研究项目的实施规则，不可作为本项目已确认事实直接写入。本章节需由医学经理依据本项目实际筛选流程、实验室检查窗口及重新筛选条件确认后撰写。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_2c8666e98041cb2f","section_number":"5.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:587fc9438b6a8b3d671eec62","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005222854_688e8b49","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"试验干预：KZ-sGC401片剂每日一次口服，低/中/高三个剂量水平，双盲双模拟，治疗期12周，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。","quote_sha256":"d7506d9f216cca901f1f59adb99b3c71591144aa3d3d695790be8034d25f9a8c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_treatment_intervention"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"剂量与给药方案：SMOKE-r4-1V口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC401）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"c30158b3828cb64fa44e6639794985bcbe859cfe1ca9cdbac8f98912178ec2a0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_dose_regimen"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照：外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景，按1:1:1:1随机分配。","quote_sha256":"f1f6aff7a4ebd367dd14c0174b7a455eac32886b24c3d7578ef76ccbfce93fc4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_placebo_control"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"研究时期：筛选期（第-28至-1天）；12周双盲治疗期（第0天随机给药至第12周）；治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）；安全随访期（末次给药后2周）","quote_sha256":"10c99dea1b0a818522b70098d13975242ac4a1084684b588ce76dbdbb8237f6c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_study_periods"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_treatment_intervention","es_dose_regimen","es_placebo_control","es_study_periods"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":4},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究治疗/干预","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期临床研究，旨在对SMOKE-r4-1V口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC401）进行概念验证与剂量探索。受试者按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至KZ-sGC401低剂量组（2.5 mg每日一次）、中剂量组（5 mg每日一次）、高剂量组（10 mg每日一次）或安慰剂组，各组均联合标准GDMT背景治疗。试验药与安慰剂均采用双盲双模拟设计，安慰剂为外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次给药，给药与访视安排同试验组。全部受试者每日晨起随餐口服给药。研究时期包括：筛选期（第-28天至第-1天）、12周双盲治疗期（第0天随机给药至第12周）、治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）及安全随访期（末次给药后2周）。访视安排为：V0筛选（第-28至-1天）完成病史采集、体格检查、ECHO、实验室检查、NT-proBNP及心电图；V1随机入组（第0天）；V2（第4周）与V3（第8周）进行疗效与安全性评价；V4治疗结束（第12周±3天）进行主要终点评价与全面安全性评估；V5安全随访（第14周）确认不良事件转归。每4周随访时评估耐受性，剂量调整按方案规定执行。","rationale":"本章正文依据当前项目已确认研究定义中的总体研究设计、试验干预、剂量与给药方案、安慰剂/对照描述、研究时期及访视策略逐项写入。医学经理需确认：'按方案规定剂量调整'的具体触发阈值与调整幅度是否在本章或独立章节展开；双盲双模拟中模拟片的具体配方与匹配验证要求；各访视中实验室检查、心电图及体格检查是否每次均实施或仅特定访视实施。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_f738c43b16eb_cdc73665abfefe92","section_number":"6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:587fc9438b6a8b3d671eec62","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:0eebb4939327b8"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261005222854_688e8b49","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"试验药物：SMOKE-r4-1V口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC401）","quote_sha256":"e023e1e44d92d9d0af38572fc6081dd6b04673a22a007b46f5a24fdaa51fd59f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_drug_identity"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"剂量与给药方案：SMOKE-r4-1V口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC401）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"c30158b3828cb64fa44e6639794985bcbe859cfe1ca9cdbac8f98912178ec2a0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_dose_regimen"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂平行对照：外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景，按1:1:1:1随机分配。","quote_sha256":"f1f6aff7a4ebd367dd14c0174b7a455eac32886b24c3d7578ef76ccbfce93fc4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_24ae925c5f71136af903:r6:2324e1714eed68be","span_id":"es_placebo_control"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfie